      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CIRICE (1) draws the rails and gets chance to find form. Last time finished 4th in a Maiden on October 2 over 515m at The Gardens behind Voulez Vroom beaten 11 lengths (30.79). Worth another chance. LUX QUEEN LILY (4) stalked the lead from the inside draw then took over turning and burst clear to score (36.33) at Richmond in a Mix over 622m. Won at her only start from this box. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. HELLO SHELLY (2) turned in a moderate effort last time when eighth at Wentworth Park over 520m behind Exorbitant (30.45) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Likely to play a prominent role. WATCH ME SOLDIER (7) has definite claims at her first try at this circuit.",
